                            <comment id="17008055" author="mmuzaf" created="Sat, 4 Jan 2020 14:51:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=antonovsergey93&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;antonovsergey93&quot;&gt;antonovsergey93&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I think we should also fix the argument comparison order for this test. &lt;br/&gt;
The message seems to be confusing too much:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;tt&gt;ComparisonFailure: line: 1 expected:&amp;lt;20&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;19&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Copyright(C) Apache...&amp;gt; but was:&amp;lt;20&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;20&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; Copyright(C) Apache...&amp;gt;&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;WDYT?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17008061" author="antonovsergey93" created="Sat, 4 Jan 2020 15:05:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=mmuzaf&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;mmuzaf&quot;&gt;mmuzaf&lt;/a&gt; The comparison order is correct. We are comparing &quot;expected&quot; utility output from .output resource file with actual (i.e. command execution output). &lt;a href=&quot;https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.12/org/junit/Assert.html#assertEquals(java.lang.Object,%20java.lang.Object&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.12/org/junit/Assert.html#assertEquals(java.lang.Object,%20java.lang.Object&lt;/a&gt;) &lt;br/&gt;
I updated year in .output resource file.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17008062" author="mmuzaf" created="Sat, 4 Jan 2020 15:08:31 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=antonovsergey93&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;antonovsergey93&quot;&gt;antonovsergey93&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Agree.&lt;br/&gt;
Thank you for your contribution.&lt;br/&gt;
Merged to the master branch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17008063" author="mmuzaf" created="Sat, 4 Jan 2020 15:11:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Cherry-picked to 2.8&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
